# HB-SAMPLE (CROSS-PORT): Melee Mario CliffAttackSlow (retail data from the vanilla disc), retargeted by bone role; owner choice: owner 2026-10-11: ledge attacks are Mario's (animation, intangibility and hitbox numbers on Goku's limbs; ledge rows stay anchored).
# Hitbox joint, size and offsets are Mario's moved to Goku's bone of the same role (a sphere on the root joint is scaled about it) and scaled by the size ratio 1.7216 (script units: build.py multiplies by 1.4286; the engine then applies Goku's built size 1.2 to the fighter, model and hitboxes alike). Damage, angle, KBG/BKB, timing, auto-cancel and IASA are unchanged; left behind: gfx, sfx.
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
body_state state=intangible
wait_until 32
wait_until 37
body_state state=normal
wait_until 40
hitbox raw=@HITW0:LEG_R:0x2C00000A@,0x05A60000,0x00000000,0xB4990B52,0x0000048B
hitbox raw=@HITW0:FOOT_R:0x2C80000A@,0x08790000,0x00000000,0xB4990B52,0x0000048B
wait_until 45
hitboxes_clear
